{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52273","headline":"诗（幷序） 三十四 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 三十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"你孝我亦孝，不绝孝门户。\n只见母怜儿，不见儿怜母。\n长大取得妻，却嫌父母丑。\n耶娘不采括（张改作「睬聒」），专心听妇语。\n生时不恭（一作「供」）养，死後祭泥土。\n如此倒见贼，打煞无人护。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52273.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52273","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}